">tame</span><span begin="02:38.412" end="02:38.798">hito</span><span begin="02:38.798" end="02:39.017">no</span><span begin="02:39.017" end="02:39.421">tame</span><span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="02:39.421" end="02:40.038">(watashi</span><span begin="02:40.038" end="02:40.304">terashi</span><span begin="02:40.304" end="02:40.863">te)</span></span></text><text for="L53"><span begin="02:40.415" end="02:40.845">a</span><span begin="02:40.845" end="02:41.287">yai</span><span begin="02:41.287" end="02:41.670">yai</span><span begin="02:41.670" end="02:42.074">yai</span><span begin="02:42.074" end="02:42.464">yai</span></text><text for="L54"><span begin="02:42.464" end="02:43.327">iitsuke</span><span begin="02:43.327" end="02:43.725">chae</span><span begin="02:44.089" end="02:44.725">konoyo</span><span begin="02:44.725" end="02:44.933">o</span><span begin="02:44.933" end="02:45.349">teki</span><span begin="02:45.349" end="02:45.552">ni</span><span begin="02:45.552" end="02:45.765">shi</span><span begin="02:45.765" end="02:46.182">te</span></text><text for="L55"><span begin="02:46.975" end="02:47.398">a</span><span begin="02:47.398" end="02:47.819">yai</span><span begin="02:47.819" end="02:48.197">yai</span><span begin="02:48.197" end="02:48.599">yai</span><span begin="02:48.599" end="02:49.003">yai</span></text><text for="L56"><span begin="02:49.003" end="02:49.798">iitsuke</span><span begin="02:49.798" end="02:50.403">chae</span><span begin="02:50.677" end="02:51.249">konoyo</span><span begin="02:51.249" end="02:51.469">o</span><span begin="02:51.469" end="02:51.866">teki</span><span begin="02:51.866" end="02:52.067">ni</span><span begin="02:52.067" end="02:52.315">shi</span><span begin="02:52.315" end="02:52.750">te</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-CN"><text for="L1">脱离“芝麻开门”的咒语 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(打开门)</span></text><text for="L2">心灵之门在不久之后即将关闭 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(打开门)</span></text><text for="L3">将我就此照亮吧 将我就此照亮吧</text><text for="L4">将我就此照亮吧 将我就此照亮吧</text><text for="L5">表面和蔼亲切 封闭的心中却空无一物</text><text for="L6">嗒嗒嗒 给我你的掌声 鼓鼓掌</text><text for="L7">大声呐喊出声竭力压抑自我</text><text for="L8">学校与工作之类的你是否了解</text><text for="L9">沦落得无能的达尔文 这究竟是怎么一回事呢</text><text for="L10">能不能产生进化呢 能否继续前进呢</text><text for="L11">我们并不知道大家有何见解</text><text for="L12">所以才有些害怕</text><text for="L13">其实我很清楚 自己“到底想怎么做” <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(“到底想怎么做”)</span></text><text for="L14">但是仍旧微笑以对</text><text for="L15">只要这样就可以了吧 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(就可以了吧)</span></text><text for="L16">希望能在自由的天空下尽情起舞</text><text for="L17">大概你已桎梏在那样的名义下</text><text for="L18">稍微有一些膨胀</text><text for="L19">“已经够了吧”</text><text for="L20">你的标准 分寸 价值观</text><text for="L21">“已经够了吧”</text><text for="L22">所以将其统统宣泄出来吧</text><text for="L23">“已经够了吧”</text><text for="L24">随心所欲 任性妄为</text><text for="L25">啊啊 停下电话与邮件 用尽各种方法</text><text for="L26">对某个人格外关注 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(将我就此照亮吧)</span></text><text for="L27">啊啊 停下电话与邮件 用尽各种方法</text><text for="L28">为了某人 为了他人 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(将我就此照亮吧)</span></text><text for="L29">那些快乐都会本能地变为苦恼吧</text><text for="L30">“早晨好”之类的问候也令人感到恐惧吧</text><text for="L31">因为会让我从中醒来</text><text for="L32">我们并不知道大家有何见解</text><text for="L33">所以才有些害怕 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(到底想怎样)</span></text><text for="L34">脱离“芝麻开门”的咒语 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(打开门)</span></text><text for="L35">心灵之门在不久之后即将关闭 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(打开门)</span></text><text for="L36">照亮我</text><text for="L37">照亮我</text><text for="L38">稍微有一些膨胀</text><text for="L39">“已经够了吧”</text><text for="L40">你的标准 分寸 价值观</text><text for="L41">“已经够了吧”</text><text for="L42">所以将其统统宣泄出来吧</text><text for="L43">“已经够了吧”</text><text for="L44">随心所欲</text><text for="L45">啊啊 停下电话与邮件 用尽各种方法</text><text for="L46">对某个人格外关注 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(将我就此照亮吧)</span></text><text for="L47">啊啊 停下电话与邮件 用尽各种方法</text><text for="L48">为了某人 为了他人 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(将我就此照亮吧)</span></text><text for="L49">啊啊 停下电话与邮件 用尽各种方法</text><text for="L50">尽情地展现出“自我” <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(照亮我)</span></text><text for="L51">啊啊 停下电话与邮件 用尽各种方法</text><text for="L52">为了某人 为了他人 （将我就此照亮吧） <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(照亮我)</span></text><text for="L53">啊呀咿呀咿呀咿呀</text><text for="L54">随便你们去说吧 终将与全世界为敌）</text><text for="L55">啊呀咿呀咿呀咿呀</text><text for="L56">随便你们去说吧 终将与全世界为敌）</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="02:52.750"><div begin="00:05.782" end="00:18.513" itunes:songPart="Intro"><p begin="00:05.782" end="00:09.081" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="00:05.782" end="00:06.403">(Open </span><span begin="00:06.403" end="00:08.701">door)</span></span> <span begin="00:06.783" end="00:07.430">『ひらけ</span><span begin="00:07.430" end="00:07.800">ごま』</span><span begin="00:07.800" end="00:08.249">から</span><span begin="00:08.249" end="00:08.641">離れ</span><span begin="00:08.641" end="00:09.081">て</span></p><p begin="00:09.079" end="00:14.907" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="00:09.079" end="00:09.658">(Open </span><span begin="00:09.658" end="00:11.479">door)</span></span> <span begin="00:10.048" end="00:10.728">閉じる</span><span begin="00:10.728" end="00:10.897">ま</span><span begin="00:10.897" end="00:11.096">も</span><span begin="00:11.096" end="00:11.527">なく </span><span begin="00:11.527" end="00:12.336">Kokorono </span><span begin="00:12.336" end="00:14.907">door</span></p><p begin="00:12.509" end="00:15.357" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:12.509" end="00:13.110">わたし</span><span begin="00:13.110" end="00:13.4